      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about burnout. it's just that everything feels so heavy and pointless without him. sometimes i look at the empty side of the bed and i just think... why am i even still here? it feels like i'm just waiting for something that's never going to happen. it's like i'm living in a ghost story.",
