      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in this waiting room. like i'm just lingering here while everyone else is moving on. sometimes i think about him and i just want to get to where he is. it feels like the only way to stop this ache is to just go and be with him. does that make any sense? that it's the only thing that would actually bring any peace?",
